    "proof": "Parseval bounds the L2 tail by omega_{N+1}^{-2}||f'||_2^2 and the derivative tail by omega_{N+1}^{-2}||f''||_2^2, where omega_{N+1}=pi(N+1)/L. Adding the two estimates proves the H1 bound. The form estimate follows by substitution. For the no-go, u=exp(i*pi*(N+1)x/L)/sqrt(2L(1+omega_{N+1}^2)) is orthogonal to the retained band and has unit H1 norm.",
